abstract: >-
  A continuation-specific identification framework for distinguishing observable
  shutdown or preservation behavior from stronger claims about stable current-bearer
  continuation control. The work combines exact counterexamples, synthetic learned-policy
  stress tests, intervention stability analysis, a domain-relative mechanism certificate,
  and a retrospective audit of the ROGUE benchmark. It does not establish AI consciousness,
  negative valence, or fear of death.
